      { icon: "lock", title: "Data security", quote: "Unlike other platforms, we don't run an OnlyFans agency—your data is safe with us.", body: "We don't run an agency either, and your data isn't with us at all. Your data stays on your server, apart from two integrations that call out by default and can be switched off: image descriptions and Giphy lookups. <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"" ~ ('/legal/privacy/' | url) ~ "\">See Privacy.</a>" },
      { icon: "gauge", title: "Better performance", quote: "up to 40% faster than other tools in the market", body: "Exactly as fast as your server. We publish no percentage." },
      { icon: "globe", title: "Your proxies, your call", quote: "Each creator is assigned a unique IP…", body: "You rent your own proxies, one internet address per creator, and assign them in Creators > Custom proxy." },
      { icon: "pulse", title: "Uptime guarantee", quote: "With 99.99% uptime in the last 90 days…", body: "No guarantee. An autoheal container restarts unhealthy services; the rest is your hosting." },
      { icon: "code", title: "Top talent", quote: "Our team includes experts from top tech companies like Microsoft, TikTok, and Facebook…", body: "Our team: whoever reads the code and sends a fix." },
